A capability-indexed unit of account for the intelligence economy.

This product includes software developed by ProofOfWork Agency as part of the
ThinkTank concept lab (https://github.com/proofofwork-agency/thinktank).

The COG-1 basket, the reference workload, the depth protocol, and the
settlement mechanics (the Settlement Fix, the fix-unavailability ladder,
chain-linking on basket change, and the Cog-Denominated Obligation) originated
with ProofOfWork Agency.

